quired for loading Trial Balance from\n\nECC required by BPC Consolidation (eg. conversion of data from Periodic to\n\nYTD, and from Key Figure to Account- based format, etc).\n\n7) Developing BW Process Chain to automate loading of Master &\n\nTransaction data from ECC to BW.\n\n8) Developing BPC Transformation & Conversion files for Master &\n\nTransaction data.\n\n9) Creating BPC Data Manager Package to schedule Master & Transaction\n\ndata load from BW to BPC.\n\n10) Developing BPC Input Schedules & Reports (complex reports are done\n\nusing Excel Macro/VBA Script).\n\n11) Setting up Ownership Percentage and Corporate Group Structure using\n\nBPC Dynamic Hierarchy Editor (DHE)\n\n12) Setting up BPC Journal for manual Consolidation adjustments (Pre & Post\n\nConsol adjustment).\n\n13) Configuration of BPC Script Logic & Business Rules for: Balance Carry-\n\nForward, Currency Conversion)\n\n14) Configuration of Automatic Adjustment Business Rules that includes:\n\nIntercompany Elimination, Consolidation of Investment (COI), Equity in Net\n\nIncome (EQIN), Minority Interest in Net Income (MINI), Minority Interest in\n\nNet Asset (MINA), Goodwill (for External Acquisition), and SNTRESS (for\n\nInternal Acquisition which is for the purpose of Group restructuring), handling\n\nPre and Post Acquisition reserves, handling Fair Value Adjustment (FVA).\n\n15) Setting up BPC Security (User, Team, Task Profile, Member Access Profile).\n\n16) Setting up BPC Work Status to lock data.\n\n17) Setting up Business Process Flow (BPF) as a guided menu for user to\n\nperform all the required activities.\n\n18) Developing BusinessObjects Xcelsius dashboards for Financial Statements\n\n(Balance Sheet & Income Statement), which fetch live data from BPC\n\nApplication.\n\n19) Conducting user training and support.\n\n20) Developing Unit Test script, troubleshooting and fixing problem during UAT\n\n(User Acceptance Testing).\n\nPage | 14 Aswin Setyawan Margono\n\n21) Preparing Functional and Technical specification documents.\n\n22) Post Go-Live support.\n\n','February 2012','December 2012'),(182,'2023-03-23 03:28:37',28,1,NULL,NULL,7,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'active','DQVZB',NULL,NULL,NULL),(183,'2023-03-23 03:28:37',28,1,NULL,NULL,7,NULL,NULL,'BANK',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'active','47SS7',' NIAGA\n\n','98/2000',NULL),(184,'2023-03-23 03:28:37',28,1,NULL,NULL,7,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'active','X3AGZ',NULL,NULL,NULL),(185,'2023-03-23 03:28:37',28,1,NULL,NULL,7,'Engineer',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'active','NTJFP',' and Programmer\n\nâ¢ PT. SUMBER DAYA PRAWEDA INFORMATIKA (move to branch) System Implementation Engineer and Web Design\n\n2. PT. SOFTWORKS SOLUTIONS (Mei 2005)\n\nâ¢ PT. RADIANT CENTRA NUSA (Outsource) Application Web Development\n\nâ¢ PT. APRISMA INDONESIA (Outsource) Application Web Development 3. PT. MITRA MANDIRI INFORMATIKA (Des ','2002',NULL),(186,'2023-03-23 03:28:37',28,1,NULL,NULL,7,'Leader',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'active','TCV5K',' Web Development 4. PT. MEGA DATAMA SOLUSINDO (Mei ','2007',NULL),(187,'2023-03-23 03:28:37',28,1,NULL,NULL,7,'Leader',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'active','QLQ9T',' Web Development and Sales Specialist 5. PT. AVRIST ASSURANCE (Des 2011)\n\nSupervisor IT Development 6. PT. FWD Indonesia (FWD â ','2010',NULL),(188,'2023-03-23 03:28:37',28,1,NULL,NULL,7,'Manager',NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'active','D92CJ',' IT Development\n\n','Feb 2014',NULL),(189,'2023-03-23 03:28:37',28,1,NULL,NULL,7,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'active','X3EMD',NULL,NULL,NULL),(190,'2023-03-23 03:28:37',28,1,NULL,NULL,7,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'active','NWIKR',NULL,NULL,NULL),(191,'2023-03-23 03:28:37',28,1,NULL,NULL,7,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,N