Customer Master, Material Master, Credit Control Master.\n\nc. Verifying the correctness of related documents generated from sales\n\nprocess, such as: Material document, Accounting document, Controlling\n\ndocument, Profit Center document.\n\nd. etc.\n\n2) Evaluating around 39 business process scenarios in MM module that covers\n\ntasks similar to StarHub MM module (read above). Example scenarios are:\n\nProcurement of Raw Materials (Hydrochloric Acid, Caustic Soda, etc),\n\nProcurement of Sub-Raw Materials (Local Purchases - Stock and Non Stock\n\nitem, Overseas Purchases - Stock item), Procurement of Services for Projects,\n\nProcurement of Expense Items (Safety Equipments or Operating Supplies), etc.\n\n3) Evaluating Authorization based on Authorization Matrix.\n\nPage | 24 Aswin Setyawan Margono\n\n4) Using LSMW to migrate Master data for SD (Pricing Procedure), MM\n\n(Release Procedure), and CO (Cost Center, Activity Type).\n\n','September 2008','November 2008'),(657,'2023-03-23 03:31:11',28,1,NULL,NULL,17,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'active','CY1VX',NULL,NULL,NULL),(658,'2023-03-23 03:31:11',28,1,NULL,NULL,17,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'active','N10CX',NULL,NULL,NULL),(659,'2023-03-23 03:31:11',28,1,NULL,NULL,17,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'active','8P5S0',NULL,NULL,NULL),(660,'2023-03-23 03:31:11',28,1,NULL,NULL,17,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'active','5EVL8',NULL,NULL,NULL),(661,'2023-03-23 03:31:11',28,1,NULL,NULL,17,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'active','WGAJZ',NULL,NULL,NULL),(662,'2023-03-23 03:31:11',28,1,NULL,NULL,17,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'active','PQ11D',NULL,NULL,NULL),(663,'2023-03-23 03:31:11',28,1,NULL,NULL,17,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,NULL,'active','AIVE6',NULL,NULL,NULL),(664,'2023-03-23 03:31:11',28,1,NULL,NULL,17,NULL,N